# symbolic SATO template
# family: Manufacturing (blank id-cust-char) / 2x7.25 / automatic (PLC)
# ported field-for-field from c:\Workspace\southalr\dtmlb002.i, dispatched from dtplc067.p's
# blank-id-cust-char branch when the line's configured include for this size is "dtlbl060d.i".
#
# REPLACES the previous generic placeholder content of this file.
#
# Base reference-move offset is fixed at "H-050V0000" -- source has a sub-choice (S86R models
# get H-025V0000 instead), but neither raw string matches this port's cataloged marketing
# names, so this defaults to the general "85x" value, same simplification used throughout this
# port for raw device-model checks with no real-catalog match. No per-hand variance otherwise
# (unlike 4.5x3, this size has no left/right split at all in the real source).
#
# Same other simplifications as lt_default_45x3.sato -- see that file's header (no setsato,
# no prt-shape-desc-s, shade/qty/UPC gates always taken, ih-label-type=1 image ref skipped).

